written continuation per level
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=1
v2 (b 0) vsource dc=1
control
  sweep outer instance="v2" parameter="dc" values=[1, 2] continuation=0
  sweep inner instance="v1" parameter="dc" values=[0, 1]
    analysis dc1 op
  sweep outer instance="v2" parameter="dc" values=[1, 2]
  sweep inner instance="v1" parameter="dc" values=[0, 1] continuation=0
    analysis dc2 op
endc
